flowchart TD
    A[Recruiter adds candidate] --> B[Profile: upload resume / paste LinkedIn — default Included in matching]
    B --> C[Activity: schedule a call]
    C --> C1{Schedule option}
    C1 -- Propose times --> C2[Pick slots · Para pre-fills message]
    C1 -- Send booking link --> C3[Share calendar link · Para pre-fills message]
    C2 --> C4[Send via LinkedIn or Email]
    C3 --> C4
    C4 --> C5[Candidate books · call lands on Activity timeline]
    C5 --> C6[Call happens on-platform · recorded + transcribed]
    C6 --> C7[Activity card: Review pending]
    C7 --> C8{Review drawer: use this call for Para AI?}
    C8 -- Yes + tags --> C9[Saved to timeline · Included in matching]
    C8 -- No --> C10[Saved to timeline · excluded]
    C9 --> J[Submit candidate to 2+ opportunities]
    C10 --> J
    J --> K[Opportunities: parallel active tracks]
    K --> P1[Para AI surfaces a scored match the recruiter didn't choose]
    P1 --> P2{Confirm proposed match?}
    P2 -- Yes --> K
    P2 -- No / dismiss --> P3[Discarded, never a track]
    K --> L[Para AI synthesizes included-in-matching context → next action per opportunity]
    L --> M{Relationship-sensitive or high-stakes?}
    M -- No, logistics --> N[Auto-executed · logged]
    M -- Yes --> O[Draft expands inline on its opportunity row]
    O --> Q{Recruiter reviews inline draft}
    Q -- Approve / Edit --> R[Sent · stage advances]
    Q -- Reject --> S[Dropped, not sent]
    N --> T[Opportunities reflects new state]
    R --> T
    K -.-> AP[Ask Para assistant · any tab]
    AP --> AP1{Ask or act?}
    AP1 -- Ask --> AP2[Cited answer from included-in-matching context]
    AP1 -- Act e.g. schedule --> AP3[Inline action card · Confirm & send / Edit]
    AP3 --> Q
    T --> HOLD{Offer arrives at one opportunity?}
    HOLD -- Yes --> H1[Para pauses its queued auto-actions on the OTHER opportunities]
    H1 --> H2{Recruiter: keep paused / resume all / review each}
    H2 --> Z
    HOLD -- No --> U{Same-company double submission?}
    U -- Yes --> V[Blocked · conflict banner · manual resolution]
    U -- No --> W[Track proceeds]
    W --> AD{Volatile context aged past threshold?}
    AD -- Yes --> AE[Flagged for reconfirmation · matching weight discounted]
    AD -- No / durable --> Z{Opportunity outcome}
    AE --> Z
    Z -- Offer / Hired --> AA[Track closed: Hired]
    Z -- No longer pursued --> AB[Track closed manually]
    Z -- Candidate withdraws --> AC[All tracks close · all pending actions cancelled]
